            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A polycyclic compound represented by Formula 1 and an organic electroluminescence device that comprises a first electrode, a hole transport region disposed on the first electrode, an emission layer disposed on the hole transport region, an electron transport region disposed on the emission layer, and a second electrode disposed on the electron transport region, wherein the hole transport region comprises a polycyclic compound represented by Formula 1:</p>
            </abstract>
